      "text": "49ers 46, Cowboys 40. SF prevails, as expected, in the promised shootout. They are now 8-1, still the NFC's #1 seed, and the NFL has to be licking its chops with what's next: The 49ers' #1 offense vs the Vikings' #1 defense in Mexico City",
